h  boredom during summer vacation in the  show the main characters Phineas and  Ferb counters summer time by turning the  backyard into a hot spot for backyard  inventions and shenanigans phineas his  sister is always trying to catch them in  the act so she can tattle on him to  their mother but it's usually  unsuccessful the show's theme song even  ends with phineas to sister yelling mama  Phineas and Ferb are making a title  sequence it's pretty cute we have to  admit these two are clever and  compelling to watch but after two  hundred and twenty two episodes maybe  it's time these boys go back to school  for the fall we'll always remember the  times Phineas and Ferb built a towering  rollercoaster in the backyard in the  very first episode and there was a Star  Wars Episode in season four made the  Ferb be with you ah summer memories but  alas the show was cancelled in 2015  summer can't last forever kids for all  you super fans out there phineas and  Ferb's zany backyard adventures continue  to stream on Netflix do you think this  show lasted too long or not long enough  leave a comment telling us what you  think The Simpsons  back in December 1989 a little animated  show called  The Simpsons premiered it featured a  warm-hearted doughnut and beer loving  dopey father named Homer Simpson his  blue haired loving wife Marge a  troublemaker son Bart a bookish activist  and saxophone player daughter Lisa and a  pacifier sucking baby who always falls  down Maggie  nobody knew it then but this show would  become the longest-running animated show  in the history of American television  with over 600 episodes in fact the  Simpsons became one of only two  television shows to air 600's ODEs ever  the other show to hold that honor with  CBS's Gunsmoke which ended in 1975 the  six hundredth episode was called  treehouse of horror 27 and they really  pulled out all the stops for this one  they even had a virtual reality couch  gag in the opening sequence which could  be view